    "detailed_description": "One day, the human body country suffered from a large area of bacteria invasion, the alarm from the human immune security department was immediately sounded, and the immune guards who received the rescue news carried many weapons immediately rushed to the scene of the incident, trying to survive and annihilate the bacteria as the tide came.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame features<br />\r\n\u25a0 The attack mode used in the game is automatic attack!<br />\r\n\u25a0 There are many areas in the game for players to play randomly, the rhythm is fast and not slow!<br />\r\n\u25a0 There are more than ten characters for players to play, each role has its own exclusive weapons, I believe there are always so many can let you adapt to!<br />\r\n\u25a0 Hundreds of upgrade options and weapons to choose from (knife, hammer, gun, scissors, etc.)!<br />\r\n\u25a0 Every time the tide of bacteria will continue to increase for tens of seconds, find a way to stick to it, in a limited time as much as possible to destroy the bacteria!<br />\r\n\u25a0 Pick up items dropped after destroying germs, and purchase or upgrade them when moving to the next area!<br />\r\n\u25a0 The game contains several different disease types of levels, each level has a unique play style, in a different type of disease to start your healing road!",
